## Setup

```bash
uv sync
```

## Running

```bash
uv run python -m {{ package_base }}
```

## Project Structure

```
src/
└── {{ package_base }}/
    ├── __init__.py
    └── modules/
        └── ...        # domain modules go here
```

Each module follows the Bedrock convention:
- `__init__.py` + `manifest.yaml` — required
- `models.py`, `entities.py`, `service.py`, `exc.py` — domain layer
- `api.py` — optional FastAPI router
- `bootstrap.py` — optional lifecycle hooks